---
title: Introduction
date: 2026-03-17
---

mixin question(q)
  div.card.my-3
    div.card-header: strong #[i.fa-solid.fa-message] #{q}
    div.card-body
      block

.row
  .col-lg.mb-3
    h2 About me
    p If you don't know me, hi! I'm DarkblooM. I'm a 23 year old computer science student from France.
    p My pronouns are... uh... all of them. I really don't care.
    p My main points of interest are:
    ul
      li computer science
      li gaming
      li music
      li motorcycles
    div
      img.img-fluid.rounded.shadow.w-auto(src="https://files.catbox.moe/6yrqpu.png" alt="DarkblooM profile picture")
      br
      sup.text-end.text-muted Profile picture by #[a(href="https://linktr.ee/offkair" target="_blank") OFFKAiR]
  .col-lg
    h2 Q&A
    +question("How did you build this website?"): p.card-text.
      I use #[a(href="https://11ty.dev/" target="_blank") Build Awesome] (formerly 11ty) to generate the whole site statically, with #[a(href="https://pugjs.org/" target="_blank") Pug] for building templates, as well as #[a(href="https://getbootstrap.com/" target="_blank") Bootstrap] for UI and #[a(href="https://fontawesome.com/" target="_blank") Font Awesome] for icons.
    +question("Are you on social media?")
      p.card-text Yes!
      a.card-link(href="https://bsky.app/profile/darkblo0m.bsky.social" target="_blank" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-title="Bluesky" style="--bs-link-hover-color-rgb: 17,133,254;"): i.fab.fa-bluesky.fa-xl
      a.card-link(href="https://threads.com/@darkbloom.io" target="_blank" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-title="Threads" style="--bs-link-hover-color-rgb: 0,0,0;"): i.fab.fa-threads.fa-xl
      a.card-link(href="https://youtube.com/@darkbloom_io" target="_blank" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-title="YouTube" style="--bs-link-hover-color-rgb: 255,0,0;"): i.fab.fa-youtube.fa-xl
      a.card-link(href="https://reddit.com/u/darkbloom_sr" target="_blank" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-title="Reddit" style="--bs-link-hover-color-rgb: 255,69,0;"): i.fab.fa-reddit.fa-xl
      a.card-link(href="https://tiktok.com/@darkbloom.io" target="_blank" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-title="TikTok" style="--bs-link-hover-color-rgb: 0,0,0;"): i.fab.fa-tiktok.fa-xl
